<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112411" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρύγᾰνον</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρύγω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dry stick</i>; mostly in pl., <i>firewood,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.62
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				642
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.111
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.3.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1027.13
			</span></i> (Cos, <span class="entity">iv/iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				28.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρυγάνοις καὶ λίθοις περιφράξαντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					603a9
				</span></i>
			: Com., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φρύγες ἐστὶ καινὸν δρᾶμα
				τοῦτ᾽ Εὐριπίδου . . ᾧ καὶ Σωκράτης τὰ φρύγαν᾽
				ὑποτίθησι</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Telecl.
				40
			</span></i>: sg. only in collect. sense 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ φρύγανα, μαντικῶς τὸ φ.
					τίθεσθαι</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				1026
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ φ. ἐπικαίουσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.553c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>undershrub,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δένδρα, θάμνος,
				πόα,</span> defined as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀπὸ
				ῥίζης πολυστέλεχες καὶ πολύκλαδον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.3.1
			</span></i>.</div>
